# Host build output. **This is the only .dockerignore Docker reads**: every
# Dockerfile in this repository builds from the repo root, and a
# `.dockerignore` inside a service directory is never consulted for a root
# context. Without these two lines `task edc:build` leaves a ~37 MB
# connector.jar and a full Gradle tree in `services/edc-connector/build/`, and
# every image build — not just the EDC one — ships them into the daemon.
#
# `build` matches a directory of that name, not `build.gradle.kts`, which the
# EDC builder stage does need.
**/build
**/.gradle
